<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Seafarers</li></ol></nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">For seafarers</p>
      <h1>Your next port. Your next connection.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Plan your mobile data for crew-change travel, time ashore and the journey home. Start with the destination and device you will actually use.</p>
      <div class="inline-links"><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= site.shopUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event="seafarer_cta_click">Find an eSIM plan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.helpUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Compatibility &amp; setup help <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="before-travel-heading">
    <div class="container split">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Before you travel</p><h2 id="before-travel-heading">Three checks before you buy.</h2><p>A little preparation helps when your itinerary includes several countries or a short connection between flights.</p><%- include('partials/media', { media: media.crewConnectivity }) %></div>
      <ol class="numbered-list">
        <li><h3>Check your phone.</h3><p>Confirm the exact model supports eSIM and that your phone is network-unlocked. Use the store's help guidance before purchasing.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Match the plan to your journey.</h3><p>Review every destination where you need data, including transit stops. Check the data allowance, validity and coverage on the plan page.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Read the activation instructions.</h3><p>Check when the plan starts and follow its setup instructions. Keep those instructions available for the journey.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-soft" aria-labelledby="seafarer-help-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Help along the way</p><h2 id="seafarer-help-heading">Choose your next step.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid-three">
        <article class="feature-card"><h3>Getting ready to travel</h3><p>A short checklist for device compatibility, plan selection and setup preparation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/esim-before-you-travel" data-event="resource_view">Read the eSIM checklist</a></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><h3>Already have a plan?</h3><p>Use the Amicus store's installation guidance for the next step in setting up your eSIM.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.installationUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Installation help <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></article>
        <article class="feature-card"><h3>Using the crew-change tool</h3><p>Register in the crew-change application to begin its workflow. Confirm arrangements with your responsible agent or coordinator.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.crewUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-event="crew_tool_click">Open crew-change tool <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></article>
      </div>
      <div class="callout support-links"><div><h3>Need help with an existing order?</h3><p>Use your store account for order information, or contact the eSIM support team.</p></div><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.accountUrl %>" data-event="account_visit">Your eSIM account ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.supportUrl %>" data-event="support_visit">Order &amp; connection support ↗</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you rely on a plan</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list">
    <details><summary>Will this work while the ship is at sea?</summary><div><p>Travel eSIMs use land-based mobile networks. They are not a substitute for the ship’s satellite connection. Check the plan’s destinations and coverage for ports and time ashore.</p></div></details>
    <details><summary>Does an eSIM-capable phone guarantee compatibility?</summary><div><p>Your exact model and regional variant matter, and the phone must be carrier-unlocked. Check both before buying.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.helpUrl %>">Read the device checks ↗</a></div></details>
    <details><summary>Does installation start the plan’s validity?</summary><div><p>That depends on the selected plan. Read the plan and delivery instructions before installing or activating it.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= site.installationUrl %>">Follow the installation guidance ↗</a></div></details>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A question about your journey?</p><h2>Let us help you find the right starting point.</h2><p>Include your destination, travel dates and phone model so your inquiry has the details that matter.</p></div><div><a class="button button-light" href="<%= site.inquiryUrls.seafarer %>">Contact Amicus</a></div></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
